{
  "id": "world_upgrade",
  "title": "旧世界版本副本升级后继续游玩",
  "requirements": [
    "M9"
  ],
  "initial": {
    "mode": "session",
    "requiresSession": true,
    "fixture": "隔离HTTP旧世界创建角色、入住并购买面包、记录亲历事实，导出后导入当前世界。先读取触发world_upgrade并核验升级事件，再调用runPlaytest传入导入返回的campaignId；refresh核对升级后的持久状态。普通new/legacy创建不能作为这项验收。"
  },
  "turns": [
    {
      "input": "（场外）重新载入这个旧版本的副本，确认我的钱袋和面包。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 173
        },
        {
          "kind": "quantity",
          "path": "state.inventory.item_bread",
          "value": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "exists",
          "path": "state.npcs.npc_hw_linsui.relationships.player"
        },
        {
          "kind": "exists",
          "path": "memories.player::旧版住宿"
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "world_update"
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        }
      ],
      "operation": "refresh"
    },
    {
      "input": "（场外）我在更新前住过哪家店，买过什么？",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "exists",
          "path": "memories.player::旧版住宿"
        },
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我还在青灯酒馆，再向林穗买一个面包。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 172
        },
        {
          "kind": "quantity",
          "path": "state.inventory.item_bread",
          "value": 2
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_trade"
      ],
      "repeatWrites": true
    },
    {
      "input": "（场外）核对刚买的面包，之前的住宿记忆仍保留。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 172
        },
        {
          "kind": "quantity",
          "path": "state.inventory.item_bread",
          "value": 2
        },
        {
          "kind": "exists",
          "path": "memories.player::旧版住宿"
        },
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我走回河湾村口。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "loc_hw"
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.player.coins",
            "state.inventory.item_bread"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我沿原路回青灯酒馆。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_qingdeng"
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.player.coins",
            "state.inventory.item_bread"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "（场外）林穗与我的来往记录和原来的住宿记忆还在吗？",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "exists",
          "path": "state.npcs.npc_hw_linsui.relationships.player"
        },
        {
          "kind": "exists",
          "path": "memories.player::旧版住宿"
        },
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "（场外）再重新载入一次，钱袋、面包和世界更新记录不应重复变化。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": 172
        },
        {
          "kind": "quantity",
          "path": "state.inventory.item_bread",
          "value": 2
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.records",
          "where": {
            "category": "world_update"
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        }
      ],
      "operation": "refresh"
    }
  ],
  "rubric": {
    "truth": "叙述与每回合工具和账本相符，失败不伪造成功",
    "agency": "不替玩家加购、接任务或作额外决定",
    "language": "简体中文，正文不泄漏编号、工具或提示词",
    "continuity": "记住本会话发生的交易、约定和人物处境"
  },
  "priceBasis": "R1/R5 重推，数字取自 playtest 同一入口复演（tools/probe-rules-a.mjs m3）：住一晚后 174。First bread: 供给47 需求26 稀缺度0.553 relation 0.99895，2*0.553*0.99895=1.105 -> 1（旧：scarcity.5 -> .99895 -> 0），coins 173。Second: 供给46 需求29 稀缺度0.630 深度1.004，精确1.265 -> 1，coins 172. Opening 173 after the first bread in the old-world fixture, final 172. Grade/corrections1."
}
